    "items": [
      {
        "type": "heading2",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "The Sons of David"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "These were the sons of David born to him in Hebron:",
          "The firstborn was Amnon the son of Ahinoam of Jezreel;",
          "the second, Daniel the son of Abigail of Carmel;"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "the third, Absalom the son of Maakah daughter of Talmai king of Geshur;",
          "the fourth, Adonijah the son of Haggith;"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "the fifth, Shephatiah the son of Abital;",
          "and the sixth, Ithream, by his wife Eglah."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "These six were born to David in Hebron, where he reigned seven years and six months.",
          "David reigned in Jerusalem thirty-three years,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "and these were the children born to him there:",
          "Shammua, Shobab, Nathan and Solomon. These four were by Bathsheba daughter of Ammiel."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "There were also Ibhar, Elishua, Eliphelet,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Nogah, Nepheg, Japhia,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Elishama, Eliada and Eliphelet—nine in all."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "All these were the sons of David, besides his sons by his concubines. And Tamar was their sister."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "heading2",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "The Kings of Judah"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Solomon’s son was Rehoboam,",
          "Abijah his son,",
          "Asa his son,",
          "Jehoshaphat his son,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          11
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Jehoram his son,",
          "Ahaziah his son,",
          "Joash his son,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          12
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Amaziah his son,",
          "Azariah his son,",
          "Jotham his son,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          13
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Ahaz his son,",
          "Hezekiah his son,",
          "Manasseh his son,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          14
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Amon his son,",
          "Josiah his son."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          15
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The sons of Josiah:",
          "Johanan the firstborn,",
          "Jehoiakim the second son,",
          "Zedekiah the third,",
          "Shallum the fourth."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          16
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The successors of Jehoiakim:",
          "Jehoiachin his son,",
          "and Zedekiah."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "heading2",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "The Royal Line After the Exile"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          17
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The descendants of Jehoiachin the captive:",
          "Shealtiel his son,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          18
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Malkiram, Pedaiah, Shenazzar, Jekamiah, Hoshama and Nedabiah."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          19
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The sons of Pedaiah:",
          "Zerubbabel and Shimei.",
          "The sons of Zerubbabel:",
          "Meshullam and Hananiah.",
          "Shelomith was their sister."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          20
        ],
        "lines": [
          "There were also five others:",
          "Hashubah, Ohel, Berekiah, Hasadiah and Jushab-Hesed."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          21
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The descendants of Hananiah:",
          "Pelatiah and Jeshaiah, and the sons of Rephaiah, of Arnan, of Obadiah and of Shekaniah."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          22
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The descendants of Shekaniah:",
          "Shemaiah and his sons:",
          "Hattush, Igal, Bariah, Neariah and Shaphat—six in all."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          23
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The sons of Neariah:",
          "Elioenai, Hizkiah and Azrikam—three in all."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          24
        ],
        "lines": [
